{"additions":1666,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nPart of #136 (PR 1 of 3): the mdBook foundation for the detailed user guide, plus the first two chapters — **Getting Started** and **Views** — shipped in English and Japanese together. Later PRs cover Configuration Basics, Config Recipes, and the Config Reference (their SUMMARY entries exist as one-line stubs).\n\n- Two mdBook books: `docs/guide/` (\"vig User Guide\") and `docs/guide/ja/` (\"vig ユーザーガイド\"), each book's first page linking to the other language.\n- `mise.toml`: `mdbook = \"0.5.4\"` in `[tools]`, plus `docs:build` (both books + GIF copy) and `docs:serve` tasks.\n- `.github/workflows/docs.yml`: builds the English book to the site root and the Japanese book to `/ja/`, deploys via `actions/upload-pages-artifact` + `actions/deploy-pages` on pushes to `main` touching `docs/guide/**`, `assets/*.gif`, or the workflow (checkout with `lfs: true`, mdBook pinned to 0.5.4).\n- README / docs/README.ja.md: prominent 📖 User Guide link near the top (Pages URL + in-repo fallback).\n- Guide key tables were cross-checked against `assets/default.kdl`; the guide additionally documents `w` (watch mode) in the GitHub issue/PR detail, which `default.kdl` binds but the README table omits.\n\nGitHub Pages is already enabled for the repo with `build_type=workflow` (done via `gh api`), so the site deploys on merge: https://td72.github.io/vig/ (ja: https://td72.github.io/vig/ja/).\n\n## Structure\n\n```\ndocs/guide/\n├── book.toml            # en book (\"vig User Guide\", site-url /vig/)\n├── rewrite_assets.py    # shared mdBook preprocessor (see below)\n├── src/\n│   ├── SUMMARY.md       # full guide skeleton; config chapters are stubs\n│   ├── introduction.md  # links to the ja book\n│   ├── getting-started.md\n│   ├── views.md         # read-only philosophy, shared conventions\n│   └── views-{git,github,files,docker,procs,worktrees,projects}.md\n└── ja/\n    ├── book.toml        # ja book (\"vig ユーザーガイド\", site-url /vig/ja/)\n    └── src/             # same chapter set, natural-Japanese translations\n```\n\nPublished layout: English book at the site root, Japanese book under `/ja/`.\n\n## How images work\n\nThe checked-in Markdown references the demo GIFs by relative path into the repo tree (`../../../assets/demo.gif`; one more `../` for the ja book), so chapters render with images on github.com's blob view (LFS media). At build time the tiny `rewrite_assets.py` preprocessor (declared in each `book.toml`) rewrites `(../)+assets/` to `assets/`, and the build step (`mise run docs:build` locally, the workflow in CI) copies `assets/*.gif` into each built book's `assets/` directory. All chapters live flat in `src/`, so the rewritten path resolves from every page. Verified locally: built HTML serves `src=\"assets/*.gif\"` with real GIF copies in place, and the source paths resolve in the repo tree.\n\nNote: mdBook 0.5 renamed the preprocessor book JSON key from `sections` to `items`; the script handles both.\n\n## Not verified\n\n- The Pages deployment itself (workflow only triggers on push to `main` — first merge will exercise it), including the mdBook release-asset download URL in CI.\n- `mise run docs:serve` renders text fine but demo GIFs only appear in `docs:build` output (noted in the task description).\n- Rendering of the guide Markdown on github.com's web UI (relative paths were verified against the repo tree, not by browsing).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":38,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-31T06:35:34Z","deletions":0,"headRefName":"docs/guide-foundation","labels":[],"number":139,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdJkTQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe guide text includes an accuracy issue about README sync, and the docs workflow install step should be hardened to avoid piping network downloads directly into `tar`.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nAdds an mdBook-based bilingual (EN/JA) “vig User Guide” and automates publishing it to GitHub Pages, while wiring in local build/serve tasks and prominent entry points from the existing READMEs.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces mdBook books under `docs/guide/` (English) and `docs/guide/ja/` (Japanese), including “Getting Started” and “Views” chapters plus view-specific pages.\n- Adds a small mdBook preprocessor (`rewrite_assets.py`) and build steps to make demo GIF references work both on GitHub blob view and on the built Pages site.\n- Adds `docs:build` / `docs:serve` tasks (mise) and a new GitHub Actions workflow to build + deploy the guide to GitHub Pages.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| README.md | Adds prominent link to the published User Guide (with in-repo fallback). |\r\n| mise.toml | Pins `mdbook` and adds `docs:build` / `docs:serve` tasks for local docs workflows. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Adds prominent link to the Japanese User Guide (with in-repo fallback). |\r\n| docs/guide/book.toml | Defines the English mdBook config + preprocessor hookup and Pages settings. |\r\n| docs/guide/rewrite_assets.py | mdBook preprocessor to rewrite repo-relative `assets/` GIF paths for the built site. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/SUMMARY.md | Adds the guide’s chapter structure (with later chapters stubbed). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/introduction.md | English introduction page, including cross-link to the Japanese guide. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/getting-started.md | English “Getting Started” chapter (install/first run/tour/requirements). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views.md | English “Views” overview (read-only philosophy, shared conventions, view switching). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-git.md | English Git view chapter (panes, modes, keys, constraints). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-github.md | English GitHub view chapter (issues/PRs/runs, watch mode, keys, constraints). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-files.md | English Files view chapter (browser layout, previews, opener actions, keys). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-docker.md | English Docker view chapter (read-only docker CLI-based inspection, keys). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-procs.md | English Procs view chapter (process/ports graphs, sampling behavior, keys). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-worktrees.md | English Worktrees view chapter (worktrees/stashes + preview behavior, keys). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-projects.md | English Projects view chapter (board/table/detail, optional pane, keys). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/configuration-basics.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-recipes.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/troubleshooting.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/book.toml | Defines the Japanese mdBook config + preprocessor hookup and Pages settings. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/SUMMARY.md | Japanese guide chapter structure (mirroring English structure). |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/introduction.md | Japanese introduction page, including cross-link to the English guide. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/getting-started.md | Japanese “Getting Started” chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views.md | Japanese “Views” overview translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-git.md | Japanese Git view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-github.md | Japanese GitHub view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-files.md | Japanese Files view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-docker.md | Japanese Docker view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-procs.md | Japanese Procs view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-worktrees.md | Japanese Worktrees view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-projects.md | Japanese Projects view chapter translation. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/configuration-basics.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR (Japanese). |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-recipes.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR (Japanese). |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR (Japanese). |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/troubleshooting.md | Stub placeholder for a later PR (Japanese). |\r\n| .gitignore | Ignores mdBook build output directories for both books. |\r\n| .github/workflows/docs.yml | Adds a Pages workflow to build/deploy English at root and Japanese under `/ja/`. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 37/38 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 3\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T06:39:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"a0acea35cd3eadb0ca4adde936c4f04cf865d72c"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdOXdw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe GitHub view key table currently mis-describes `Tab`/`Shift+Tab` behavior vs the default bindings, so the guide should be corrected to match the source-of-truth config.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 37/38 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 2\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T06:51:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"a0acea35cd3eadb0ca4adde936c4f04cf865d72c"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdb35Q","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"a0acea35cd3eadb0ca4adde936c4f04cf865d72c"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdb46w","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"4468bb2aae07737440fea95e960ae8abd1cd9f24"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdb50Q","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"4468bb2aae07737440fea95e960ae8abd1cd9f24"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdb6vQ","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"4468bb2aae07737440fea95e960ae8abd1cd9f24"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLdb8FA","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"4468bb2aae07737440fea95e960ae8abd1cd9f24"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLddb3w","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe new Pages workflow should align with existing repo conventions by updating actions/checkout from v4 to v6.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 37/38 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-08-31T07:28:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"4468bb2aae07737440fea95e960ae8abd1cd9f24"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T08:34:15Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33373523182/job/99429736338","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-08-31T08:34:16Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T07:25:34Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33368238846/job/99413328221","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:31Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:56Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33368238885/job/99413328276","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:30Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T07:25:27Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33368238846/job/99413328215","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:32Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T07:26:49Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33368238846/job/99413327947","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-31T07:24:31Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-31T07:26:49Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsU